0677 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281256 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281256 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281256 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186280675 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281256 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "ee676f82-5c11-53e9-9b1a-845255b4b041" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281677 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186281008 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281677 #edb/ref 1069 "q-163578" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281677 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281677 #edb/ref 1071 "A rectangular plate of mass $M$ and uniform mass density occupies the region\n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le 3\\}.$ Find the radius of gyration of the plate about the origin." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281677 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "c52b9e07-a1a1-59e3-9b59-f3ce7c050afb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186281677 #edb/ref 1074 "For a plane lamina in the shape of a region $D$ with mass $M$ and mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The radius of gyration ${R}_{x}$ about the $x$-axis is given by\n${R}_{x}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{x}}{M}},$\nwhere ${I}_{x}$ is the moment of inertia about the $x$-axis.\n\n- The radius of gyration ${R}_{y}$ about the $y$-axis is given by\n${R}_{y}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{y}}{M}},$\nwhere ${I}_{y}$ is the moment of inertia about the $y$-axis.\n\n- The radius of gyration ${R}_{0}$ about the origin is given by\n${R}_{0}=\\sqrt{\\frac{{I}_{0}}{M}},$\nwhere ${I}_{0}$ is the moment of inertia about the origin.\n\nThe moment of inertia about the origin is defined as\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A,\n$$\n\nwhere $\\lambda (x,y)$ is the mass density function.\n\nThe area of the rectangular plate $D$ is $A=1\\cdot 3=3.$ Since the plate has uniform density, the mass density function is given by\n\n$$\n\\lambda (x,y)=\\frac{M}{A}=\\frac{M}{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the origin is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3}{[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+x{y}^{2}]}_{x=0}^{x=1}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{3}+{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}{[\\frac{1}{3}y+\\frac{1}{3}{y}^{3}]}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}(1+9) \\\\  & =\\frac{10M}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n{R}_{0}^{2}=\\frac{10}{3}\\,⇒\\,{R}_{0}=\\sqrt{\\frac{10}{3}}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186282153 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{\\frac{5}{2}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186282153 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186282153 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "33b3b03b-db7c-5e14-bf30-0c8e621a1cd4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186282344 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{\\frac{14}{5}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186282344 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186282344 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4c6feef2-1cdf-5a8f-af31-d193a5e7b5d8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283043 #edb/ref 1080 "\\sqrt{\\frac{7}{3}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283043 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283043 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9b583607-518c-5a2b-857a-27893d2e3e6f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283769 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{5}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283769 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283769 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ee827f89-c824-5a29-84e7-d603d75dd34b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283814 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283814 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283814 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f2efdc3d-8ffc-5626-8aeb-007c3da3965a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283995 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186282153 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186283995 #e